cff-version: 1.2.0
message: |-
  If you use HanziGen in your research, please cite both the software
  and its paper as described in the preferred-citation below.
title: "HanziGen"
abstract: >-
  HanziGen is a deep-learning-based Chinese font generation and completion
  system. It combines a VQ-VAE with a latent diffusion model (LDM) to
  synthesize missing glyphs in a target font style conditioned on reference glyphs.
keywords:
  - chinese-font-generation
  - font-completion
  - latent-diffusion-model
  - vq-vae
  - deep-learning
